      "reviewed": true,
      "translation": "Then what follows? On this he says, with the verse beginning ‘tatra.’ Since in every action these five are the causes, this being so, one who nevertheless sees the Self—which is absolute, without limiting adjuncts, and unattached—as the agent, because his understanding is unrefined through abandoning the teaching of scripture and teacher, is of wrong understanding; that person does not see correctly.",
